      "description": "现有 `implement` runner、branch preflight、takeover gate、frozen revision gate 必须继续保留。 新增 plan gate 之后： - 不得破坏 native-single / native-team / adapter runners - 不得破坏现有 implement summary / technical archive - 不得破坏现有 story / revision writeback ## 6. Suggested Output Contract ### 6.1 Implementation plan JSON ```json { \"schema_version\": \"1.0\", \"plan_id\": \"plan-001\", \"feature\": \"beacon-prd-us-to-plan-implementation-progress-closure\", \"version\": \"v1.1.12\", \"revision_id\": \"R1\", \"baseline_hash\": \"sha256:...\", \"plan_hash\": \"sha256:...\", \"status\": \"planned\", \"source_refs\": { \"user_story\": \"docs/beacon/v1.1.12/user-story/....md\", \"prd\": \"docs/beacon/v1.1.12/prd/....md\", \"test_case\": \"docs/beacon/v1.1.12/qa/test-cases/....md\" }, \"tasks\": [ { \"task_id\": \"TASK-001\", \"title\": \"...\" } ] } ``` ### 6.2 Plan preflight blocked output ```json { \"schema_version\": \"1.0\", \"status\": \"blocked\", \"blocked\": true, \"reason_code\": \"implementation_plan_missing\", \"expected_plan\": \"docs/beacon/v1.1.12/.machine/execution/implementation-plan-....json\", \"recommended_command\": \"beacon implement plan ...\" } ``` ## 7. Success Standard 这条线完成时，Beacon 应能稳定做到： 1. 从 PRD / user-story / test-case 编译出 implementation plan 2. 在 implement 开始前阻断 plan 缺失或 baseline 不一致的情况 3. 让实现过程拥有 task-level 进度，而不仅是 run-level 结果 4. 让 writeback 可反查到 AC / TEST / task 的对应关系 5. 让 status / help 能清楚说明当前实现进度与下一步任务 6. 不破坏现有 implement / workflow / gate 的主链语义 ## 8. First-principles Loop 正确链路应是： ```text user-story + prd + test-case → prd-us-to-plan compile → implementation plan → plan gate → implement execution → task progress writeback → status / review / verify ``` 不是： ```text user-story + prd → runner prompt → implementation summary only → task status unknown ```",
